Subject: [PATCH 9/9] webapp: enter Knowl instead of the default Town Square topic

Keep the required internal channel out of research navigation and send the
pilot-only initial route to the assistant DM; the full plugin retains its
research-topic landing screen. See
 docs/guides/organization-hosting-pilot.md, Default workspace navigation.
---
